From: "pocketforge-agent[bot]"
 <299760760+pocketforge-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 14:10:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] hw/input: add PocketForge A133 deterministic controls

Attach a gamepad-compatible virtio-input device to the second modern
virtio-mmio transport of the pocketforge-a133 machine.

Expose ordered QOM press and release injection while rejecting malformed,
late, or out-of-order transitions and queue exhaustion.

Advertise the evdev identity and capabilities consumed by PocketForge.
Cover identity, every navigation mapping, negative controls, reset, and the
optional no-device machine setting with qtest.

